---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-auto bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-900 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Author -->
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif font-bold text-base">
            अ
          </div>
          <span class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">
            Artha Atlas
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
          Authored by <strong>Chirag Singhal</strong>. An independent research portal dedicated to unvarnished empirical analysis of Indian investment avenues, statutory frameworks, and taxation laws.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://buymeacoffee.com/chirag127"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white text-xs font-medium transition-colors shadow-sm"
          >
            <span>☕</span>
            <span>Support this work</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Exploration Hubs -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Knowledge Base
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href={`${base}/start-here/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">The Investor Roadmap</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/avenues/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Complete Avenues Catalog</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/compare/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Comparison Engine</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/allocation/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Asset Allocation Lab</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/calculators/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Quant Calculators</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/glossary/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">500+ Term Glossary</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Legal & Regulatory -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Law & Protection
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href={`${base}/tax/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Indian Tax Centre (FY 2026-27)</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/laws-and-regulators/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Statutory Regulators (SEBI/RBI)</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/scams-and-fraud/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">BUDS Act & Scam Red Flags</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/books/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Indian Financial Library</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/changelog/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Regulatory Changelog</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Author Links & Connect -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Connect & Author
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:chirag@oriz.in" class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
              <span>📧</span>
              <span>chirag@oriz.in</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/chirag127" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
              <span>🐙</span>
              <span>github.com/chirag127</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://facebook.com/singhal127" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
              <span>👤</span>
              <span>facebook.com/singhal127</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/about/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">About Chirag Singhal</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/disclaimer/`} class="hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">Statutory Disclaimer</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Statutory Disclaimer Banner -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 space-y-2">
      <p>
        <strong>Statutory Notice & Regulatory Status:</strong> Artha Atlas is an educational, journalistic, and empirical research publication authored by Chirag Singhal. The author is not registered with the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) as an Investment Adviser (RIA) or Research Analyst (RA), nor registered with the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) or IRDAI.
      </p>
      <p>
        None of the information, models, comparison tables, mathematical formulas, or historical returns published on this website constitute individualized financial, investment, legal, or tax advice. Market investments are subject to market risks including potential total capital loss. Readers must perform independent due diligence and consult certified financial planners (CFP) or chartered accountants (CA) before committing capital.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between pt-4 text-stone-500">
        <div>
          &copy; {currentYear} Chirag Singhal. All Rights Reserved.
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 sm:mt-0 space-x-4">
          <a href={`${base}/disclaimer/`} class="hover:underline">Disclaimer</a>
          <a href={`${base}/about/`} class="hover:underline">About</a>
          <a href={`${base}/sitemap-index.xml`} class="hover:underline">Sitemap</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
